Meta-port for the REVYTECH Wayfire desktop stack on FreeBSD / CloudBSD.

Installs:
  - revytech-wf-config
  - revytech-wayfire
  - revytech-wayfire-plugins-extra
  - revytech-wf-shell (panel, dock, background, wf-settings)
  - revytech-wcm
  - common session helpers (seatd, kanshi, mako, wlogout, alacritty)

All components are built from github.com/revytechinc/* master/main tips
pinned in revytech/wayfire/VERSIONS.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/wayfire
